WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
The native Threadmark app shows forecast.ts and its imports and exports.

00:10.000 --> 00:28.000
Selecting an import reveals its exact source line and TypeScript adapter evidence.

00:28.000 --> 00:36.000
The Impact view lists code reachable through reverse static relationships.

00:36.000 --> 00:45.000
Expanding an evidence path reveals the import behind the relationship.
